flowchart TD
    A[Resume Upload Request]

    A --> B{Declared / Streamed Size<br/>Within Limit?}
    B -->|No| R1[Reject: File Too Large]
    B -->|Yes| C[Ignore Client Path<br/>Extract Filename + Extension Only]

    C --> D{Extension Allowed?<br/>PDF / DOCX}
    D -->|No| R2[Reject: Unsupported Type]
    D -->|Yes| E{MIME Type Allowed?}

    E -->|No| R3[Reject: Invalid MIME]
    E -->|Yes| F{File Signature Matches<br/>Expected Format?}

    F -->|No| R4[Reject: Type Mismatch]
    F -->|Yes| G[Generate Server-Side File ID<br/>Never Trust Client Path]

    G --> H[ClamAV Malware Scan]

    H --> I{Malware Detected?}
    I -->|Yes| R5[Reject + Delete Temporary File]
    I -->|No| J[Accept Resume]
